-life  drama and part damning examination of  police brutality googlers sobering film  premiered at the 2013 Sundance Film  Festival winning the hearts of festival  audiences and a couple of the festival's  top prizes Fruitvale station's  undeniable virtues were further praised  on the international stage when it made  its way to can and according to color  lines received a rousing standing  ovation
 

